{"speciesId":135,"names":{"fr":"Voltali","es":"Jolteon","en":"Jolteon","ja":"サンダース"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"It accumulates negative ions in the atmosphere to blast out 10000- volt lightning bolts."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"It accumulates negative ions in the atmosphere to blast out 10000- volt lightning bolts."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"A sensitive POKé­ MON that easily becomes sad or angry. Every time its mood changes, it charges power."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It concentrates the weak electric charges emitted by its cells and launches wicked lightning bolts."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Every hair on its body starts to stand sharply on end if it becomes charged with electricity."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"The negatively charged ions generated in its fur create a constant sparking noise."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"JOLTEON’s cells generate a low level of electricity. This power is amplified by the static electricity of its fur, enabling the POKéMON to drop thunderbolts. The bristling fur is made of electrically charged needles."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"JOLTEON’s cells generate a low level of electricity. This power is amplified by the static electricity of its fur, enabling the POKéMON to drop thunderbolts. The bristling fur is made of electrically charged needles."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Its cells generate weak power that is amplified by its fur’s static electricity to drop thunderbolts. The bristling fur is made of electrically charged needles."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"If it is angered or startled, the fur all over its body bristles like sharp needles that pierce foes."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It accumulates negative ions in the atmosphere to blast out 10,000-volt lightning bolts."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It controls 10,000-volt power and can raise all the fur on its body as if it were sharp needles."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It controls 10,000-volt power and can raise all the fur on its body as if it were sharp needles."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"If agitated, it uses electricity to straighten out its fur and launch it in small bunches."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It concentrates the weak electric charges emitted by its cells and launches wicked lightning bolts."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Every hair on its body starts to stand sharply on end if it becomes charged with electricity."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Face au danger, il fait appel à l’électricité pour dresser ses poils et lancer des décharges."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"If agitated, it uses electricity to straighten out its fur and launch it in small bunches."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Face au danger, il fait appel à l’électricité pour dresser ses poils et lancer des décharges."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"If agitated, it uses electricity to straighten out its fur and launch it in small bunches."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"By storing electricity in its body, it can shoot its bristlelike fur like a barrage of missiles."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"By storing electricity in its body, it can shoot its bristlelike fur like a barrage of missiles."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Chaque poil sur son corps se dresse quand il se charge en électricité."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Todos los pelos de su cuerpo se ponen de punta si empieza a cargarse de electricidad."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Every hair on its body starts to stand sharply on end if it becomes charged with electricity."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"体内に 電気が たまると 全身の 体毛が 全部 鋭く とがりはじめる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il se charge d’électricité statique pour envoyer des décharges de 10 000 V."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Acumula iones negativos de la atmósfera para lanzar rayos de 10 000 voltios de potencia."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It accumulates negative ions in the atmosphere to blast out 10,000-volt lightning bolts."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"空気中の マイナスイオンを 吸いこんで 約１００００ボルトの 電気を 吐き出すことがある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les cellules de Voltali génèrent un courant de faible intensité. Ce pouvoir est amplifié par l’électricité statique de ses poils, ce qui lui permet d’envoyer des éclairs. Sa fourrure hérissée est faite d’aiguilles chargées d’électricité."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Las células de Jolteon generan un nivel bajo de electricidad, cuya intensidad aumenta con la electricidad estática que acumula en un pelaje formado por agujas cargadas de electricidad. Esta característica le permite lanzar rayos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Jolteon’s cells generate a low level of electricity. This power is amplified by the static electricity of its fur, enabling the Pokémon to drop thunderbolts. The bristling fur is made of electrically charged needles."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"細胞の 出す 弱い 電気を 体毛の 静電気で 増幅させ カミナリを 落とす。 逆立った 体毛は 電気を 帯びた 針。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les cellules de Voltali génèrent un courant de faible intensité. Ce pouvoir est amplifié par l’électricité statique de ses poils, ce qui lui permet d’envoyer des éclairs. Sa fourrure hérissée est faite d’aiguilles chargées d’électricité."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Las células de Jolteon generan un nivel bajo de electricidad, cuya intensidad aumenta con la electricidad estática que acumula en un pelaje formado por agujas cargadas de electricidad. Esta característica le permite lanzar rayos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Jolteon’s cells generate a low level of electricity. This power is amplified by the static electricity of its fur, enabling the Pokémon to drop thunderbolts. The bristling fur is made of electrically charged needles."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"細胞の 出す 弱い 電気を 体毛の 静電気で 増幅させ カミナリを 落とす。 逆立った 体毛は 電気を 帯びた 針。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il peut projeter des décharges de 10 000 volts. Il est très nerveux, ce qui le rend difficile à apprivoiser."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Lanza rayos de 10 000 voltios de potencia. Es difícil congeniar con este Pokémon debido a su naturaleza nerviosa."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"They send out electrical charges of about 10,000 volts. Because they are high-strung, it can be difficult to grow close to them."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"約１００００ボルトの 電気を 吐き出す。 かなり 神経質で なつかせるのは 大変だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Quand son pelage se hérisse, c’est signe qu’il va projeter de l’électricité. Attention, car il arrive que la foudre tombe près de lui."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Cuando su pelaje se pone de punta, es señal de que va a soltar una descarga. Hay que tener cuidado porque pueden caer rayos cerca."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"When its fur stands on end, that’s a sign it’s about to give off a jolt of electricity. Take care, as sometimes lightning strikes next to it, too."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"体毛が 逆立ったら 電気を 吐く サイン。 側に 雷が 落ちることも あるので 注意。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Un organe situé à l’intérieur de ses poumons produit de l’électricité. On entend une sorte de crépitement chaque fois qu’il expire."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Posee un órgano en los pulmones que genera electricidad. Cuando respira se puede oír un crepitar eléctrico."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its lungs contain an organ that creates electricity. The crackling sound of electricity can be heard when it exhales."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"肺の 中に 電気を 生み出す 器官が ある。 吐息に 混ざって 電気の 音が バチバチ聞こえる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il projette ses poils hérissés comme si c’étaient des aiguilles, avant d’achever ses ennemis ainsi affaiblis avec des décharges de 10 000 volts."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Lanza sus pelos erizados a modo de púas. Tras debilitar a su rival, lo remata con una descarga de 10 000 voltios."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its fur stands on end, becoming like needles it fires at enemies. Once they’re weakened, it finishes them off with a 10,000 volt shock."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"逆立てた 毛を 針の ように 飛ばす。 敵が 弱った ところを １万ボルトの 電撃で 仕留める。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Un Pokémon très sensible et lunatique. Il se charge en électricité chaque fois que son humeur change."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Un Pokémon muy sensible que se entristece o enfada con mucha facilidad. Se carga de electricidad cada vez que cambia de humor."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"A sensitive Pokémon that easily becomes sad or angry. Every time its mood changes, it charges power."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"ちょっとした 刺激で 泣いたり 怒ったりする。また 感情が 変わるたびに 電気がたまる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Un Pokémon très sensible et lunatique. Il se charge en électricité chaque fois que son humeur change."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Un Pokémon muy sensible que se entristece o enfada con mucha facilidad. Se carga de electricidad cada vez que cambia de humor."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"A sensitive Pokémon that easily becomes sad or angry. Every time its mood changes, it charges power."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"ちょっとした 刺激で 泣いたり 怒ったりする。また 感情が 変わるたびに 電気がたまる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"S’il est irrité ou surpris, toute la fourrure de son corps se dresse comme des aiguilles pour percer ses ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Si se enfada o asusta, se le eriza el pelaje. Cada uno de sus pelos se convierte en una afilada púa que hace trizas al rival."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"If it is angered or startled, the fur all over its body bristles like sharp needles that pierce foes."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"怒ったり 驚いたりすると 全身の 毛が 針の ように 逆立って 相手を つらぬく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il se charge d’ions négatifs contenus dans l’air pour envoyer des décharges d’environ 10 000 volts."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Acumula iones negativos de la atmósfera para lanzar rayos de 10 000 V de potencia."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It accumulates negative ions in the atmosphere to blast out 10,000-volt lightning bolts."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"空気中の マイナスイオンを 吸いこんで 約１００００ボルトの 電気を 吐き出すことがある。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Bristles its fur into sharp, needlelike points when enraged. One can hear electricity crackle in its breath when it exhales."}],"varieties":[{"id":135,"moves":[{"name":"pay-day","learns":[[19,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-kick","learns":[[1,"level-up",42],[2,"level-up",30],[3,"level-up",30],[4,"level-up",30],[5,"level-up",30],[6,"level-up",30],[7,"level-up",30],[8,"level-up",29],[9,"level-up",29],[10,"level-up",29],[11,"level-up",29],[12,"level-up",30],[13,"level-up",30],[14,"level-up",17],[15,"level-up",17],[16,"level-up",17],[17,"level-up",17],[18,"level-up",17],[19,"level-up",10],[20,"level-up",25],[23,"level-up",25],[25,"level-up",25],[28,"level-up",42],[29,"level-up",42]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",8],[3,"level-up",8],[4,"level-up",8],[5,"level-up",8],[6,"level-up",8],[7,"level-up",8],[8,"level-up",8],[9,"level-up",8],[10,"level-up",8],[11,"level-up",8],[1